        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "All operations under argon. A reaction mixture of YCl3 and Na(pzMe2) in THF was refluxed for 6 d. The solvent was completely removed in vacuo and replaced by toluene. After filtration of precipitated NaCl, the solution was concentrated to half its initial volume, giving colorless crystals of 1b. Extraction/replacement of THF by toluene substitutes the two sodium-bound THF ligands with two 3,5-dimethylpyrazole ligands.",
